{"synopsis":"Lu Ye, Nine-Lives Heavenly Sovereign yang dikagumi semua orang, pada hari dia naik ke alam Immortal, justru dikhianati oleh delapan Empress yang dibesarkannya sendiri. Nine Heavens Sword Princess: “Karena kau, seluruh dunia memanggilku sebagai pelayanmu!” Fairy Hong Ling: “Kalau bukan karena kau, aku sudah menjadi pasangan abadi dengannya. Kau pantas mati!” Vermilion Demon Empress: “Kau bilang mereka yang menyakitiku? Justru yang menyakitiku adalah dirimu sendiri!” Dengan Space-Time Reversal, Lu Ye terlahir kembali. Di kehidupan baru ini, dia bersumpah tidak akan mengulangi kesalahan yang sama, dan membiarkan delapan wanita itu menghadapi nasib mereka sendiri!","alternative_title":"八女帝全背叛，重生悔到肠断","author":"番茄小说, 李3疯","artist":"熊漫社","chapters":[{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"6ca1313f-f748-441d-91f0-b7214611dcce","date":"2026-07-29","images":[]},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"7e19d386-1397-40f7-917e-89857fc001ec","date":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"325f6cdc-9858-48a5-ae31-d0e42e0e819e","date":"2026-07-15","images":[]},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"b7479dc6-c0f4-481a-a891-354471deb32a","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"def31fa1-66de-4e49-b93f-ef035eb2282b","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"56414b99-1d6b-4485-895d-d4645a8b5f3d","date":"2026-06-24","images":[]},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"b4ccb641-4bd9-475c-bdfc-d9d0daf66687","date":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"2ffea846-05cc-4173-a411-289545b5f155","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"e0fb9515-2355-409d-8c23-ae94fac8f023","date":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"bd7b9f3c-a4c0-4567-a1b3-f8486c8eb0b7","date":"2026-05-27","images":[]},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"a237462b-8ff1-493d-9043-490fb6a0e83e","date":"2026-05-20","images":[]},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slu